{"src":"en","tgt":"pt","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"pt","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5826.989836000001,"text":"Lions are the most social cats living in large groups called prides."},{"kind":"text","t":6185.060425,"text":"Os leões são os felinos mais sociais, vivendo em grandes grupos chamados alcateias."},{"kind":"audio","t":6254.8242310000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6258.243463000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6260.295554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6261.436818,"samples":27096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":11435.06445,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":11716.985523,"text":"No clima quente do Oriente Médio, a casa não era tão importante."},{"kind":"audio","t":11758.293221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11761.316178,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11762.425512,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"input","t":17726.138619999998,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":18077.836739,"text":"São quase todas praias de areia com banho seguro e a maioria tem sombra proporcionada por"},{"kind":"audio","t":18135.349388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18140.628213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":18146.000877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18149.983811,"samples":28896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"input","t":20579.100437,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":20713.152806,"text":"árvores pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":20761.721860999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":20761.886068,"samples":832,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":26120.420402,"text":"Brides are made up of 1 to 3 related adult males along with us"},{"kind":"text","t":26509.10302,"text":"As noivas são compostas por 1 a 3 machos adultos parentes, juntamente conosco."},{"kind":"audio","t":26553.790209,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26559.051564999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26564.574717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26567.053802,"samples":21696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":32643.448518999998,"text":"Feral children may have experienced severe child abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"text","t":33066.565744,"text":"Crianças selvagens podem ter sofrido abusos infantis graves ou traumas antes de serem abandonadas ou fugirem."},{"kind":"audio","t":33126.525159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33131.979922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33137.317957,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33142.793639999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33147.798919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":33148.087895,"samples":1760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":38544.846001,"text":"Scottport Bus 403 travels regularly to Centra stopping at Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":38996.526593,"text":"O autocarro 403 de Scottport viaja regularmente para Centra, com paragem em Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":39050.172916999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39051.655335999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39053.087836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39054.555795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39055.248285,"samples":20128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":45858.63052,"text":"To get the best views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head for the Kowloon waterfront opposite."},{"kind":"text","t":46344.852585,"text":"Para ter as melhores vistas de Hong Kong, saia da ilha e siga para a zona ribeirinha de Kowloon, em frente."},{"kind":"audio","t":46402.917586999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46407.942936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46413.411479,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46418.882372,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46419.254646,"samples":8128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":51225.648475,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":51634.282584,"text":"Eram aceitas as visões de Aristóteles sobre todas as questões da ciência, incluindo a fisiologia."},{"kind":"audio","t":51691.640886,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51696.939771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51702.424164,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51707.712259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51708.692315,"samples":13528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":61155.358695,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's competitor"},{"kind":"text","t":61563.373882,"text":"O australiano Mitchell Gowrie terminou em 11º lugar no Super G masculino, competidor de Chet."},{"kind":"audio","t":61622.842384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61627.999450999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61633.340976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61638.593092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61641.025087,"samples":20728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":67030.474126,"text":"Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":67340.22794900001,"text":"Ulrich Joklin terminou em 16º lugar no Super G masculino sentado."},{"kind":"audio","t":67395.789416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67401.16315000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67406.56313400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67408.693224,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":73778.00915900001,"text":"The city is in stark contrast to the rest of the country's cities because it is more of an Arabic flair than of an Arabic flair."},{"kind":"text","t":74202.464275,"text":"A cidade está em forte contraste com as demais cidades do país porque tem mais um toque árabe do que um toque árabe."},{"kind":"audio","t":74262.185933,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74267.423089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74272.67641500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":74278.05378900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74282.015803,"samples":29128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"input","t":84762.989161,"text":"Also, after revolution, occupants were open to all male applicants, allowing the most ambitious and successful to succeed."},{"kind":"text","t":85406.926653,"text":"Além disso, após a revolução, as vagas estavam abertas a todos os candidatos do sexo masculino, permitindo que os mais ambiciosos e bem-sucedidos prosperassem."},{"kind":"audio","t":85460.770864,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85461.88224800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85463.52438500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85465.16230200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":85466.70672,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":85468.45536600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85470.01589400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85470.425438,"samples":10624,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":91857.168487,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":92360.038107,"text":"A bomba de fissão funciona com base no princípio de que é necessária energia para reunir um núcleo com muitos prótons e nêutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":92412.123573,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92417.27755000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92422.763403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92428.08557800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92433.522991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92435.274976,"samples":17960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":97446.46990800001,"text":"He did not set a figure for the cuts, saying they will be made based on China's economic output."},{"kind":"text","t":97872.053828,"text":"Ele não definiu um valor para os cortes, afirmando que eles serão feitos com base na produção econômica da China."},{"kind":"audio","t":97930.637992,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97931.99004300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97933.71742900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97935.215528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97936.48752000001,"samples":32728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"input","t":105774.170383,"text":"There is no universal definition for which manufactured items are antiques. Some tax agencies define goods older than 100 years."},{"kind":"text","t":106109.289109,"text":"Não existe uma definição universal sobre quais itens manufaturados são antiguidades. Algumas agências fiscais definem bens com mais de 100 anos."},{"kind":"audio","t":106166.74466800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106172.060104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106177.645445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106182.74244300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":106182.990669,"samples":328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":106243.65431400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106248.84785100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106252.663897,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"input","t":113940.188687,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":114285.104065,"text":"No arquipélago e nos lagos, você não precisa necessariamente de um iate."},{"kind":"audio","t":114353.336943,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114358.769916,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114364.17499000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114364.82351100001,"samples":12696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":123585.40667800001,"text":"The aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest whole number ratio, is therefore said to be 3 to 2."},{"kind":"text","t":124213.239027,"text":"A proporção deste formato, dividindo por 12 para obter a razão de números inteiros mais simples, é, portanto, dita ser de 3 para 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":124277.79170700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124282.814276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124288.22758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124293.83656000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124299.08547600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124304.51155000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124305.25063000001,"samples":12192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":131845.97451899998,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":132348.68383199998,"text":"É renomado por ser um epicentro do luxo que começou por volta de 400 d.C. e durou até u"},{"kind":"audio","t":132408.49893899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":132413.65722599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132419.05612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132424.31115599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132424.685341,"samples":9328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":136088.026304,"text":"until about 1100 AD."},{"kind":"text","t":136322.850764,"text":"até cerca de 1100 d.C."},{"kind":"audio","t":136374.693343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136376.101383,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":145362.836097,"text":"Cancellation policies vary but as of late March most coronavirus based cancellation policies don't extend to July 2020 when the Olympics"},{"kind":"text","t":146124.876654,"text":"As políticas de cancelamento variam, mas, desde o final de março, a maioria das políticas de cancelamento baseadas no coronavírus não se estendem até julho de 2020, quando as Olimpíadas"},{"kind":"audio","t":146194.68784899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146195.998561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146197.50665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":146199.049658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146200.730174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146202.323332,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146203.958679,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146205.508637,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146205.911031,"samples":15656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":154631.20838,"text":"Swirl the two dry powers together and then with clean wet hands squeeze them into a ball"},{"kind":"text","t":155164.006349,"text":"Misture os dois pós secos e, em seguida, com as mãos limpas e úmidas, aperte-os até formar uma bola."},{"kind":"audio","t":155212.26191899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155217.406136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155222.82919,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155228.197694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155230.82148699998,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":162239.217302,"text":"St. Petersburg cruises include time in town. Cruise passengers are exempted from visa requirements."},{"kind":"text","t":162529.556649,"text":"Os cruzeiros para St. Petersburg incluem tempo na cidade. Passageiros de cruzeiros estão isentos de requisitos de visto."},{"kind":"audio","t":162573.324122,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162578.461859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":162582.114728,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":30,"o